  "description": "A from-scratch rich text editor control for Avalonia, built purely on the TextLayout engine. Supports inline formatting, paragraphs, lists, tables (with cell merge), images, hyperlinks, HTML/JSON round-trip, find/replace, undo/redo, CJK IME, a Word-style A4 page view, and print/PDF page rendering.",
